# Deployment
Source: raulrgleon/moveapp. DNET source path: /home/raul/moveapp, SSH alias dnet.llc.
New hosting uses Coolify service MovePilot AI and Cloudflare Tunnel at https://movepilotai.com.
The old SSH alias moveapp, PM2 workflow and /var/www/moveapp are historical; never deploy there.
Verify build and scoped tests, review secret-free changes, commit and push authorized changes.
Build Dockerfile as dnet-movepilot:current on DNET, preserving the previous image for rollback.
Use the existing Coolify service generated compose; recreate only app after a healthy database.
Never initialize or reset an existing database. deploy/00-schema.sql is only for an empty new volume.
Keep encrypted runtime credentials in Coolify and uploads/database volumes intact.
Verify health, authenticated access and HTTPS after deployment. Do not restart other DNET apps.
The canonical domain is movepilotai.com. Preserve its mail DNS records. Ask Raul before choosing/changing any domain or subdomain.
